'''Thyon–Qym relations''', or '''Qymo–Thyonese relations''', are the historical and bilateral relations between the [[Thyon|Empire of Thyon]] and the [[Qym|Kingdom of Qym]]. The two countries have a long and often contentious relationship stretching back to the Iron Age. 

